sequenceDiagram
    participant R as Remote
    participant S as SIGNALduino
    participant G as HA gateway
    participant M as MQTT broker
    participant H as Home Assistant
    R->>S: Real RF telegram
    S->>G: Native raw frame
    G->>G: Parse and validate native SensorEvent
    G->>M: Retain descriptor and discovery
    M->>H: Automatically create switch / cover
    G->>M: Non-retained inferred action state
    M->>H: Update action state
    G->>M: Offline during shutdown
    M->>H: Unavailable
    G->>M: Subscribe after restart
    M->>G: Retained validated descriptor
    G->>M: Rediscovery and online, no invented RF event
